 ["THE MAP makes the steering directions of a model's activations visible and named. Every token generation can have a small decision tree trained on it, so the reason for each token is readable, and what a region of a model does is named. The goal it serves is the interpretable teaching of [[t:pedagogy]]."
 "Before Smile, in October 2023, I noted that classifiers are interpretable and adjustable. “Use cases are niche and classifiers are interpretable and adjustable.”[[m:2023-10-14]]"
 "In October 2026 the aim was named as THE MAP keeps it. On 5 October, “This will be a fully interpretable, documented, comprehensible, extensible and flexible agentic system with models where you can see and adjust weights semanticaly”.[[m:2026-10-05]] On 6 October, “make sure u battle test small decision trees, interpretable classifiers, sparse weights, transformations into interpretable repreentations and visualization”.[[m:2026-10-06]]"
